                    <p class="cmp-general-hero__category p2">Company</p>
                    <h1 class="cmp-general-hero__heading">Sustainability</h1>
                    
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    

</div>


    
    
    <div class="colour-block"><div class="my-width-full colour-block colour-block-white-white margin-bottom-minus-16 padding-top-32 dark-text" data-component="true">
    <div class="responsivegrid layout-flex align-center">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--small--12 aem-Grid--default--12 aem-Grid--xsmall--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn--small--none aem-GridColumn--offset--xsmall--0 aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn--xsmall--12 aem-GridColumn--xsmall--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--small--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--small--0 aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-0892d54dd9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Macquarie recognises the importance of sound Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) practices as part of its responsibility to a broad range of investors, counterparties, clients, employees, and the communities in which Macquarie operates.</p>
<p>Our Sustainability approach is structured around areas considered to be relevant to our business and stakeholders.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="colour-block aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="my-width-full colour-block colour-block-green-7-green-7 margin-bottom-minus-8 padding-bottom-32 dark-text" data-component="true">
    <div class="responsivegrid layout-flex align-center">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="cta aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--tertiary cmp-cta--long light blue  p2" href="/assets/macq/investor/results-and-presentations/2026/macquarie-group-fy26-annual-report.pdf#page=64" target="_self" title="FY2026 Macquarie Group Sustainability Report PDF (pages 64 to 119 of the MGL 2026 Annual Report)">
        
        <span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">FY2026 Macquarie Group Sustainability Report PDF (pages 64 to 119 of the MGL 2026 Annual Report)</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-e101f8dde6" class="cmp-text">
    <p>In our own business operations, we seek to manage environmental and social impacts by monitoring and reducing our operational emissions, developing sustainable workplaces, being efficient with energy and resource use, and improving the sustainability and diversity of our supply chain.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
    
